{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_006_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c634d09b4e288dfa0edb81896bb7a5ff48eef79ae9b72b7ed676b3501b9c5a7b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:931f19a7b73dda10d6002c81cffdea32ade3d1cf5b0fbb3d92006c0d345bc34f",
      "text": "哇啊！这是情人节的巧克力对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ba2ce8b0afaf76b73cc61c9874d73122c5faa87d1a747ec4b9c19c415f7d8d5",
      "text": "没想到能收到●●●●プロデューサー 送的巧克力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac89bddbec2d7f9db4797aa986204ee200201d04fce5191c636ebeba60ee9d3",
      "text": "我非常开心！谢谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e4219ada68ffa497d65414ab84e70d371ad81203d454d5f9be8fb9388c770b2",
      "text": "呵呵，一想到这是制作人特意为我挑选的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86048b6999b630554f8b52cb65fa777bd4cba4c16437ece9d2600bcecbd45337",
      "text": "虽然吃掉有点舍不得，但我会好好珍惜着吃掉的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee2c3b5bc8591e4561467806b9027dace500a271a348023d32ed06582e431b4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。谢谢您送的情人节巧克力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:039cb8944922fbbda684757953ab866da1d21b22dbed3524f48fbf8090d729e4",
      "text": "没想到居然能收到制作人送的巧克力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad9238e76b75375eae7c75015e14a4128c5469cafea2ec1c18faaf2213646b42",
      "text": "欸嘿嘿，我特别开心。我会好好品尝的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:965d80d8473fcad8f7d69cd3b9839765d4011efe17213b8e4b8a40e8d19effc8",
      "text": "没想到你能这么开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8817afa5f7cdfdb7920634c74b4750f4ce94ba795b0887f0b856d85512f3c018",
      "text": "我在里面注入了满满的PASSION",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d272f643988ee7fee6427459e7b96f5a9ad5ef870d679274995deac2db24f6ca",
      "text": "不好意思。因为太高兴了，不小心闹得太欢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:654365d88c74e81e98999fa2c709f0d3bd9ac76ce95d3699b61181b4cabc7344",
      "text": "啊哈哈，是这样吗。总觉得能从中获得满满的元气呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34212fa143eae7042e6f53007b693ba8aebbdf475c92dce5db578f5e3c7b192c",
      "text": "接下来的训练课，我感觉能比平时更加努力了。啊，这盒巧克力……什么时候吃好呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7c0c72dbed1b56db3d550699eea963ffc68e8be238612a87d96246e2baacaf",
      "text": "是在练习间隙吃呢，还是留到结束之后当作奖励呢……嗯——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce7c12d0889834e97064d34170affb985bcfea14f8d0de10824815e9672a2fe",
      "text": "……好！我决定了。就当作努力完成练习后给自己的奖励吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30cc5d28bbe9a63e4f3eaf9812366e8babdf0f635676be0b31b72d23eefc43b0",
      "text": "那么，我再去加把劲练习了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_006_22:5_01_006_22_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b38735f87245b04f3842c2f61f1e6f41080aae90310ba0723b7683d8b016fa",
      "text": "对了。白色情人节的回礼，还请您好好期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
